# Eagle's Rescue: "{2}{W/U}{W/U}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield attached to target creature you control with
# power 1 or less. Activate only as a sorcery." Bot1's Rescue on its Ornithopter is destroyed by Bot2's Disenchant on turn 2. On
# turn 3, with a Mox Emerald spell on the stack, the ability is not offered (refused: only as a sorcery). Once it has resolved and
# a Savannah Lions has taken the Mox Pearl's {W}, Bot1's untapped sources - Sapphire, Jet, Ruby and Emerald - make four mana but only
# one that is white or blue, which cannot pay the two {W/U} (refused). On turn 5, with the Pearl and Sapphire both there, it is paid,
# and the Rescue is back on the Ornithopter (a 2/4, flying).

